{"slug":"single-number-ii","id":137,"title":"Single Number II","difficulty":"Medium","tags":[],"fn":"singleNumber","params":[["nums","int[]"]],"types":["int[]"],"ret":"int","cmp":"exact","desc":"<p>給你一個整數陣列 nums，除某個元素<strong>僅出現一次</strong>外，其餘每個元素都<strong>恰好出現三次</strong>。請你找出並返回那個只出現了一次的元素。</p>\n<p>你必須設計並實現線性時間複雜度 <strong>O(n)</strong> 的演算法，且使用<strong>常數級 O(1) 的額外空間</strong>來解決此問題。</p>","constraints":[],"starter":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def singleNumber(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        ","typescript":"function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number {\n    \n};","javascript":"/**\n * @param {number[]} nums\n * @return {number}\n */\nvar singleNumber = function(nums) {\n    \n};"},"examples":[{"args":[[2,2,3,2]],"out":3},{"args":[[0,1,0,1,0,1,99]],"out":99}],"tests":[{"args":[[1]],"out":1},{"args":[[-2,-2,-2,1]],"out":1},{"args":[[658129410]],"out":658129410},{"args":[[-1462973501,-353221394,-2077529015,1551411165,1871397127,-1703359502,-757907596,538736751,63144256,-1992029484,-1232017595,76139725,63144256,77175961,-1872744521,1871397127,-1867406550,1102916082,-939275305,-530288157,1290080107,1102916082,-1012362111,1281495476,1290080107,-1462973501,538736751,-1703359502,-353221394,-1012362111,-1078262685,1871397127,76139725,-2077529015,77175961,1290080107,-1872744521,-939275305,-757907596,-1012362111,-685544427,1102916082,63144256,938868401,-1992029484,2027203163,-757907596,-1232017595,77175961,1281495476,2027203163,938868401,-1992029484,-1078262685,-1867406550,-679720386,1389344639,-2077529015,76139725,1551411165,1551411165,-679720386,-1232017595,-1078262685,2027203163,-939275305,-1179394768,1281495476,-1703359502,-178267312,-685544427,538736751,1907938014,-530288157,-353221394,-679720386,-1179394768,-1872744521,938868401,-1867406550,-530288157,-685544427,1389344639,1907938014,-1462973501,-1179394768,1907938014,1389344639]],"out":-178267312},{"args":[[1297222673,-703105912,1297222673,-703105912,-2146147253,400875063,1482620979,400875063,1951033585,40087